<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">【人物名片】</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); PADDING-TOP: 0px">黄伟中，绍兴一中物理教师，1990年从浙江师范大学物理系毕业后参加工作，2001年进入绍兴一中工作至今。长期在一线从事物理教学和班主任工作，亚洲物理竞赛金牌教练。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018092809584739.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; WIDOWS: 1; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; COLOR: rgb(95,156,239); FONT-SIZE: 14px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); PADDING-TOP: 0px">“金牌教练”与“得意门生”亦师亦友</SPAN></STRONG><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　记者见到黄伟中的时候，他正在给学生们讲课。当天，黄伟中老师剃着平头，架着一副眼镜，略显精瘦的身体，很符合中年理科老师的形象。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　黄伟中当了28年的物理老师，2003年开始从事物理竞赛辅导工作，其间曾3次把学生送入浙江省队，两次把学生送入国家集训队，辅导的学生中，1人获得全国物理竞赛金牌，获得浙江赛区金银牌的则有10多人。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　问及黄伟中的“得意门生”，原本有些拘谨严肃的他逐渐放松起来。对于学生的培养，他有一套自己的法则，根据学生不同的特质，因材施教。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　比如吴宇恺同学，性格内向沉稳，黄伟中与他结成亦师亦友的关系。吴宇恺同学2008年进入绍兴一中后，选择参加物理竞赛。经过大大小小的比赛历练，在2010年顺利进入浙江省队。黄伟中说，当年带他去厦门参加决赛时的情形，还历历在目。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　两人在行程中，基本上一路都在探讨题目。吴宇恺正式参加比赛，黄伟中说自己比他还要紧张，但又不能在他面前表现出来，也不能给他施加压力，只是嘱咐他吃东西要小心，注意身体。大约一周时间里，黄伟中住在赛事举办地周边的小旅馆，两人一起探讨知识点、设计实验方案、查分数、等反馈，最终吴宇恺同学取得了全国第九名的好成绩，顺利进入国家集训队。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　在集训队的50天里，黄伟中与吴宇恺通过手机短信保持联系。念及学生独身在外，黄伟中抽了一个周末去北京看他，周五下午启程，为不耽误课程，周日下午返回。在这两天时间内，黄伟中也陪着他做实验、讨论题目。当然，黄伟中也有被难住的时候。“我能给他的，更多的是心理上的安慰与支持。”黄伟中说。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　2011年，吴宇恺赴以色列参加比赛，荣获第十二届亚洲物理竞赛第一名，黄伟中得知消息后终于喘了口气，说：“总算功德圆满了。”事后，吴宇恺还把比赛赢得的奖品送给黄伟中，表达对恩师的敬重和感恩之情。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　而2016年选择物理竞赛的蔡格非同学，性格就比较开放一点，情绪相对外露。黄伟中在对他的引导上就不一样，特别是当他有畏难情绪时，黄伟中会采取比较严厉的态度，推着他勇往直前。2017年，蔡格非成为绍兴地区（也是全省）唯一一个以高二学生身份参加全国物理竞赛并最终进入国家集训队的同学。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　提及这些过人的教学成绩，黄伟中仍保持着谦逊的本色。他说，选择参加物理竞赛并能走到最后的学生，是因为他们有良好的天资和对物理学科满腔的热爱，而他只是做了一个引路人，在自己能力范围内给予学生指导。他常以平视的眼光与学生相处，与他们保持着亦师亦友的关系。</SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); PADDING-TOP: 0px">着重培养学生独立思考能力</SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 25px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; WHITE-SPACE: normal; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></SPAN></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>全国金牌教练、市优秀班主任，市先进工作者……提起这些荣誉，黄伟忠并不是很在意。他认为：在其位，谋其职，教书育人都是分内之事。当了17年班主任的黄伟中，尽管是一名理科老师，对学生却很重视人文教育，注重培养学生独立思考的能力。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>黄伟中平时喜欢看些历史，特别是中国近现代史，欣赏苏轼、蔡元培、林则徐等人的士大夫精神。他说，以史为鉴，可以知兴替，明白很多道理。所以平时他对学生的教育以理为点，以人文为线，努力培养他们健全的人格。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>近几年，黄伟中注意到一个变化，学生相较于前几年更听话、更“被动”。可能是因为现在的家长对教育更重视，焦虑感增强，给学生报各种补习班，导致他们重复学习。进入高中时，成绩单都很好看，但实际上他们有点像浮肿病人，自我管理能力、对知识的整理和消化能力、思维能力、学习的信念和决心等都有待加强。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>考虑到这个情况，黄伟中比较注重对学生的心理疏导，改变他们的学习观念。他给学生自由的成长环境，但首先要给他们制定规则，比如进了教室，或者进了实验室，一定要保持安静，养成独立思考的好习惯。让他们在不逾矩的情况下实现班级“自治”。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>“我不希望学生是被人推着前进，而是自己主动向前冲，特别是竞赛，更需要一种奋勇向前的信念。”他说。而黄伟中自己也是这样以身作则的，不到最后一刻，不轻易放弃任何一名学生。2018届的沈定宇同学，刚入学时，对物理比较感兴趣，然而他却阴差阳错选择了参加数学竞赛，最后在数学竞赛中没有取得理想成绩。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>数学竞赛已经没有机会，就在离物理竞赛考试还有半个月左右时，沈定宇想在物理上搏一把。黄伟中觉得沈定宇有物理学习方面的天赋，于是选择和他并肩作战，每天早上7点不到就进实验室，晚上10点半以后才离校，给沈定宇“开小灶”，补落下的知识点。就这样昏天黑地坚持了半个月，最终沈定宇获得第34届全国物理竞赛浙江赛区一等奖，并以此获得北大青睐，最终被北大物理系录取。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><BR style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px"></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; PADDING-TOP: 0px">　　</SPAN>黄伟中说，他经常教育学生对自己的未来要有一种使命感。既要有林则徐“苟利国家生死以，岂因祸福避趋之”的担当，也要有苏东坡“回首向来萧瑟处，归去，也无风雨也无晴”的豁达。</P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><A href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NzI2ODY4NA==&amp;mid=2651861325&amp;idx=4&amp;sn=8f1ba52c71401bdf2a52a429640dee08&amp;chksm=bd380cee8a4f85f810eb1065c3bc10f79a6950fe4c52b4929e45e5511cc6d659b0329749e68d&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=23&amp;srcid=0921R9EmdywylxmE4VxPUSZ8#rd">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NzI2ODY4NA==&amp;mid=2651861325&amp;idx=4&amp;sn=8f1ba52c71401bdf2a52a429640dee08&amp;chksm=bd380cee8a4f85f810eb1065c3bc10f79a6950fe4c52b4929e45e5511cc6d659b0329749e68d&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=23&amp;srcid=0921R9EmdywylxmE4VxPUSZ8#rd</A></P>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; WORD-WRAP: break-word !important; CLEAR: both; PADDING-TOP: 0px"> </P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 121.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 9.0; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（摘自绍兴晚报</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>2018</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">年</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">月12</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">日</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family